    "identifier": "fangs-of-python",
    "description": "<p>The chthonic enemy of the sun’s hatred swells within you; it’s seething rage like poison to your chakra. Make a ranged taijutsu attack toward a target within range. On a hit, you deal your [Weapon’s damage] + 2d12 necrotic damage and the affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw being Dazed on a failed save. If the affected creature fails their save by 10 or more, they instead being Petrified for 1 minute or until they take damage, whichever occurs first.</p>\n<p>| Ullr Ammo – Skadi Marked / A Creature that is Skadi Marked radiates with a soft blue mist that only the creature that inflicted the mark can see. Creatures of your choice that deals damage to a Skadi marked creature can reroll their damage, taking the higher result. |</p>\n<p>Chain 2: A creature instead becomes Petrified if they fail by 5 or more.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B rank, increase the cost by 3 and damage by 1d12.</p>",
